return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Taarifa za oda kupitia SMS na WhatsApp kwa duka lako, zilizotumwa kupitia Zinn® Campaigns chini ya jina la duka lako lenyewe. Unganisha kwa mbofyo mmoja; hakuna funguo za kubandika.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Taarifa za Agizo','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Duka lako limeunganishwa kwenye Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'Duka lako limetenganishwa. Hakuna ujumbe utakaotumwa.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Muunganisho huo ulichukua muda mrefu sana au ulianzishwa katika kivinjari kingine. Bonyeza Unganisha tena.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® haikukubali muunganisho. Bonyeza "Unganisha" tena; ikiwa itaendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na usaidizi wa Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Tovuti yako haikuweza kufikia Zinn®. Hakikisha kwamba mpangishaji wako anaruhusu miunganisho inayotoka nje, kisha ubonyeze «Unganisha tena».','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'Watumie wateja wako taarifa za maagizo yao kupitia SMS na WhatsApp, chini ya jina la duka lako mwenyewe, zikilipwa kutoka kwa salio lako la Zinn®.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Unganisha inafungua Zinn® katika dirisha hili. Ingia au ufungue akaunti, idhinisha duka hili, nawe utarudi moja kwa moja hapa. Hutawahi kubandika ufunguo.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Unganisha kwenye Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini Zinn® haikuweza kufikiwa sasa hivi. Tutajaribu tena hivi karibuni.','Store'=>'Duka','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'Wazi kwa akaunti yako','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Bado haijafunguliwa kwa ajili ya akaunti yako. Zinn® itakutumia barua pepe itakapokuwa tayari.','Disconnect'=>'Tenganisha','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuunganisha duka hili.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Huruhusiwi kukata muunganisho wa duka hili.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ukaribishaji wa Zinn® kwa WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyojengwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizodumu, vikoa na nafasi za viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — waajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kama taaluma yao','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizo tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutuma maombi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa sasisho hili. Angalia kuwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.']];